Name:Rules pilot NNN - Spirit Guides are not creatures
Goal:Survive
Turns:1
Difficulty:Medium
Description:You control Llanowar Elves and Elvish Mystic, and have Myr Superion, two Simian Spirit Guides and Lightning Strike in hand. The opponent is at 20 life. End the turn with Myr Superion on the battlefield and the opponent at 17 life.
Rule:rulesguru-bbd69ab26d190bc5 | Myr Superion can be paid only with mana produced by creatures; a Simian Spirit Guide in hand is a creature card, not a creature (CR 109.2), so its mana cannot pay for Superion: the Elves pay for Superion and the Spirit Guides for Lightning Strike
